  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC Phase-Out Management Plan in XPS Sector in China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the HPMP in XPS Foam Sector in the first stage (2011-2015) is to manage the HCFC phase-out plan, which ensures the HCFC consumption in the XPS Foam sector is frozen in 2013 and realizes 10% reduction in 2015 by a series of activities.</narrative>
  </description>
